        {
            "type": "comment",
            "content": "// Test 210_077: `!*` residual in consumer dispatch (metatype-bound,\n// engaging form). Per the pay-for-nothing rule (see EFFECT_BRANCHES.md),\n// bare `!* |> _` is rejected — residual must engage. The optional\n// `?warning` branch is already silently ignorable without any marker\n// at the dispatch site; the metatype-bound residual here demonstrates\n// the reflective-observer shape, where the consumer pays the runtime\n// cost in exchange for tier-1 reflection on which branch fired.",
            "module": "input",
            "location": {
                "file": "tests/regression/200_COMPILER_FEATURES/210_PARSER/210_077_effect_residual_dispatch/input.kz",
